<title>USA: Thermo-Mizer to buy back common stock.</title>
<headline>Thermo-Mizer to buy back common stock.</headline>
<dateline>RIDGEFIELD, N.J. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo-Mizer Environmental Corp said on Tuesday that it will repurchase up to $125,000 of its common stock in open market transactions.</p>
<p>The company also said in a statment that it had hired Continental Capital &amp; Equity Corp to advise the company on a variety of matters, including acquistions.</p>
<p>Thermo-Mizer designs and sells products used to monitor environmental conditions.</p>
</text>
